     "text": "白面团滚圆后，用肉色面团擀成椭圆形，贴在白面团上",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/65afc859e1154445b51c351de088f666_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "把羊角粘合，然后如图用黑色和粉色做表情",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/7c8f5478ca874b78811c24bef9a4e35a_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "【金牛座】黄色滚圆，肉色做脸，咖啡色搓水滴状，然后压扁做头发",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/d5a3cfad07734f2b8b4b260f62034671_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "表情做好后用棕色面团搓水滴状，做牛角",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/f48df4a0885b40338220efca8a46146c_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "黄色和粉色组合做耳朵，配件粘合好即可",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-7.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/e7eaf6544dc840bd869d53fc735e7fba_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "【双子座】蓝色滚圆后，一半地方用红色包裹，蓝色和红色做类似兔耳朵配件",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-8.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/fb6655789bf3465cb516144870d4c592_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "表情和头发做好即可",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-9.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/04c34f1073d64d89b2c4550a6f5ea22f_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "【巨蟹座】红色滚圆后，用相同方法做脸部，红色搓细条做螃蟹脚和钳子",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-10.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/12b1aca1646f488eab7fc0e7fbe419eb_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "【狮子座】橙色滚圆后，脸部用肉色粘合，然后用橙色做鼻子，牙签搓洞洞，黑色做狮子眼睛和鼻子",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-11.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/8a6bc1a0ceac4104b662b247edc230f5_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "黑色和粉色做人脸的表情后，用棕色搓圆球做狮子毛",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-12.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9a3f3198d7da4a11a04d79b87de5aa40_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "【处女座】粉色滚圆后，肉色做脸，黄色搓小球粘合头部，粉色搓水滴做装饰，如图",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-13.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/3289d9bb80764b8eaa1be0e4aaae55a2_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "装饰表情和头发",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-14.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c37c39c37ebc4a0799b1973e6134f36d_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "【天秤座】黄色滚圆后整形如图，兔子的形状",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-15.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9a7bddf53f4a45fa92b65c86ad9ea1c6_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "橙色擀薄片，包裹耳朵尖部",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-16.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/68c0e5a502164203ab7a6ad104664ea8_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "装饰表情和头发",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-17.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/e48d915089a44e3186a6ace05f3323a8_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "【天蝎座】黑色滚圆后，肉色做脸部，装饰表情和头发，黑色做蝎子钳子和尾巴",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-18.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/e2c8fd6bf49644ecbc615b80ae40fa62_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "【水瓶座】蓝色滚圆后整形做花瓶的样子，然后蓝色搓细条做瓶子的耳朵，粘合",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-19.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/4d26922413344906b9a7769217623917_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 20,
     "text": "装饰表情和头发",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-20.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/393c753bc4214347a90485238677ad11_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 21,
     "text": "【摩羯座】灰色滚圆后整形如图，兔子状，但注意，耳朵是尖的",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-21.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/2c1a326840e045c69876f9bd13428c26_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 22,
     "text": "利用刮板，将耳朵如图折叠弯曲",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-22.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9b0c2cf0c2c04b49ad406b681ab35a1f_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 23,
     "text": "装饰表情和头发",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-23.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/1a5ef6af14264d2fab51b3131daaa999_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 24,
     "text": "【双鱼座】橙色滚圆，搓成如图水滴状",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-24.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/89261ba1ecec461d8e1587059ae8b0dc_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 25,
     "text": "用手捏出鱼的形状，利用翻糖模具压出鱼鳞型",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-25.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9d731e30b6754b3bb8e8f139b7dadd5d_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 26,
     "text": "黑色做出鱼眼睛和嘴巴，然后用肉色做脸部，装饰头发，眼睛和腮红即可",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-26.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/ab652c6e5a1143c193876dba38fd6f37_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 27,
     "text": "【射手座】紫色滚圆后，搓成尾巴很长的水滴状，然后如图弯曲",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-27.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/5c20c83ee2ec47c49940d1e9f261a24e_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 28,
     "text": "做脸部，装饰表情和头发，最后用肉色做耳朵和小手",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-28.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/29da7fc2b22748c68eeda786bd817779_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 29,
     "text": "大集合完成图",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-29.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/dac56a91ed8d4a1789c5aab3e3170dcd_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 30,
     "text": "调至‘恒温发酵’模式，35度30min，发酵至1.5倍大小即可",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-30.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c11f06092be94e5bac49e29f822c5854_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 31,
     "text": "发酵完成后，将蒸箱调至‘蒸制模式’100度15min，程序结束后，焖2min开箱门。或者用蒸锅冷水上锅，大火煮开后转中火一共15min，关火焖2min开盖子",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-27/steps/103660653-31.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/5c1a4d4d9764424185948d321239f7ab_4032w_3024h.jpg"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
